Domain Entity Account
    documentation 'This financial entity represents a funding source combined with its purpose and
                  'type of transaction. It provides a formal record of the debits and credits 
                  'relating to the specific account.
    string AccountNumber
        documentation 'The alphanumeric string that identifies the account.
        is part of identity
        min length 1
        max length 50
    descriptor AccountCode
        documentation 'The set of account codes defined for the education accounting system organized 
                      'by account code type (e.g., fund, function, object) that map to the 
                      'account.
        is required collection
    integer FiscalYear
        documentation 'The financial accounting year.
        is part of identity
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'Relates the account to an Education Organization.
        is part of identity